.el .ds Aq '
.TH pcx-extract 1  "pcx 0.1.1"
.SH NAME
pcx\-extract \- Extract exactly one ROS 2 PointCloud2 Point Frame as PCD
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpcx extract\fR <\fB\-\-topic\fR> [\fB\-\-frame\fR] [\fB\-\-at\fR] <\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR> [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-\-encoding\fR] [\fB\-\-memory\-limit\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIINPUT.mcap\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Extract exactly one ROS 2 PointCloud2 Point Frame as PCD
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-topic\fR \fI<TOPIC>\fR
Topic whose messages are counted as Point Frames
.TP
\fB\-\-frame\fR \fI<INDEX>\fR
Zero\-based Point Frame index after Topic selection
.TP
\fB\-\-at\fR \fI<DURATION>\fR
First Point Frame at or after this duration from recording start
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<PATH|\->\fR
Output PCD path, or \*(Aq\-\*(Aq for binary\-safe stdout
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Replace an existing output file
.TP
\fB\-\-encoding\fR \fI<ENCODING>\fR [default: binary]
PCD payload representation
.br

.br
[\fIpossible values: \fRbinary, ascii]
.TP
\fB\-\-memory\-limit\fR \fI<BYTES>\fR [default: 536870912]
Hard managed\-memory limit in bytes
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIINPUT.mcap\fR>
MCAP Source containing the Point Frame
